<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Energy yr profit falls to NZ$57 mln.</title>
<headline>FCL Energy yr profit falls to NZ$57 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year yr to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				    57 vs 64</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 12.6 vs 16.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  5.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				     831 vs 730</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				 45 vs 83</p>
<p>    Tax (credit)				   8 vs debit 26</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	358.49 vs n/a</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation tax credit credits</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 6</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Ex div   Oct 29</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Challenge Energy Division Ltd is the oil, gas and energy exploration division of Fletcher Challenge.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected a net profit of around NZ$45-6 million.  </p>
<p>Balance sheet (in billions unless stated)</p>
<p>    Current assets			   0.211 vs 0.480</p>
<p>    Total assets			     2.626 vs 2.934</p>
